The particle textures in tools/textures/ (packed into
mixins/fallingleaves/data/tiles.rgba by tools/tiles.mjs) and the icon in
mixins/fallingleaves/data/icon.png are Falling Leaves' own
(src/main/resources/assets/fallingleaves/, MIT). The texts of the settings
screen are Falling Leaves' English and Russian language files (MIT).

The settings screen (mixins/fallingleaves/cloth.rs) follows Cloth Config by
shedaniel (https://github.com/shedaniel/cloth-config, LGPL-3.0), rewritten in
Rust; its sprites in mixins/fallingleaves/cloth_sprites.rs are Cloth Config's
texture (assets/cloth-config2/textures/gui/cloth_config.png), converted to
rows of pixels by tools/sprites.mjs, and its texts are Cloth Config's and
Falling Leaves' own.

This port rewrites Falling Leaves' particles, wind, leaf and snow spawning and
settings in Rust for Horizon's native mod API. It is not affiliated with
RandomMcSomethin, Mojang or Microsoft.
